-- Owned by the `exit` atom. `the target` is the exit being traversed.

-- Move the actor through the portal and tell the players already there.
-- mua shows the mover the new room once the Request settles.
on traverse actor
  put the portal of the target into portal
  if the to of portal is nothing then
    show actor, the msg of portal otherwise "That exit leads nowhere."
    return
  end if

  ask world to resolve the to of portal
  put it into dest
  if dest is nothing then
    show actor, "That exit leads nowhere."
    return
  end if

  ask world to find dest, "player"
  put it into others
  moveTo actor, dest
  repeat for each other in others
    show other, the name of the player of actor & " arrives."
  end repeat
end traverse
